WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Crouching light punch deliberately whiffs before the reversal.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.150
JP guards Ryu’s recorded Drive Reversal.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.050
Jumping medium kick connects during punish-counter recovery.

4
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:03.650
Walking forward brings standing heavy punch into the portal-assisted juggle.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:03.950
Heavy Departure replaces the portal as Ryu falls.
